    "conversations": [
      {
        "id": "mai",
        "lines": [
          "MaiChào buổi sáng! Pull",
          "MaiMời bạn ngồi! For coffee, watch the slow drip of cà phê sữa đá, nice and strong. For architecture, stroll Lê Lợi to Nguyễn Huệ for Tòa Thị Chính and the Opera House, then Đồng Khởi to Nhà thờ Đức Bà and the Post Office."
        ],
        "source": "Live NPC conversation"
      },
      {
        "id": "alex",
        "lines": [
          "AlexChào buổi sáng! Beautiful light on the Opera House today, right? Look at how the morning sun hits those columns — what detail catches your eye first?",
          "AlexOh, tuyệt vời! For architecture, look up at the Opera House arches and carvings — lovely curves this morning. Wander Đồng Khởi for shop façades, then the cathedral and Post Office square. Coffee first?"
        ],
        "source": "Live NPC conversation"
      }
    ]
